  "overview_description": "Read the root organisation of your Exsited instance, with its name, type, contact and address fields.",
  "intro": "The organisation endpoint reads the root organisation of your Exsited instance: its name, type, contact and address fields. The root organisation is read only. This area has 1 endpoint, and all seven SDKs call every one.",
  "warning": null,
  "notes": [
    "**The response sits under `organization`, spelled with a z.**",
    "**The root organisation is read only.** A `PATCH` to `/settings/organisation` returns `405`.",
    "**The root's `type` is `root`, and it names itself as its `parent_organization`.**",
    "**Child organisations are a separate area.** They are listed under `/settings/organisations`, and the root is never among them."
  ],
